      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("What’s this? It appears the orcs have surrounded a dwarvish enclave. And by the sound of the bellowing I hear, I think our old friend, Olurf, is here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You again? Maybe ye were not completely wrong when ye predicted the orcs would attack us. We ha’ been forced from our home and are now surrounded."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Let us give them aid — it’s clear they need it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Help them? They would not even let us pass through their land to avoid the trolls. You remember, Kalenz?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Our enemy is the orcs, not the dwarves. Besides, the orcs are in our way. Olurf, we cannot let you have all the fun here!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("For an elf, you think like a dwarf! I think I like you! <small>(_whisper^—For an elf...)</small>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "scenario_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The orcs ha’ been defeated. My lord, we are in your debt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We must put aside our differences and ally against the orcish menace. Olurf, join us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Dwarves, ally with elves? I owe ye a debt, but my kin willna’ be happy at the thought."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The Orcs are advancing on Wesmere, and a great battle will soon be upon us. If you can cover our flank to the north, I will pay you 400 gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("A proper contract for good money? That’s a different matter; I’m sure I can find some o’ my people willing to fight on those terms!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("What? Kalenz, are you out of your mind? Surely you will not throw away 400 gold on this scheming mercenary!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Where there’s a contract, our honor is involved. We will be there to cover your northern flank or else I will return your gold!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I sense no falsity behind his speech, my lord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I, too, believe him. Dwarves may be... rough... by our standards, but they are not liars. I think he knows that if he does not honor his contract, next time we will not be there to come to his aid."),
          },
          {
            tag: "gold",
            side: 1,
            amount: -400,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "gold.ogg",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Kalenz%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I am defeated. Now the orcs will destroy us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
